╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

┌─ IDENTITY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Binary:    tylluan-nexus.exe (kernel) + tylluan-cli.exe     │
│ Port:      :4000 (kernel, primary) │ fallback :4001         │
│ Config:    tylluan.toml                                     │
│ Auth:      .tylluan-token (bearer, gitignored)              │
│ Data:      data/*.db (sqlite) + data/silva.db (vectors)     │
│ License:   MIT (public product)                             │
│ Tests:     291 kernel lib + 88 link + 2 evals = 381 total   │
│ Build:     cargo build --release -p tylluan-kernel          │
│ Start:     .\tylluan-mcp.bat (from repo root)               │
│            auto-builds release if target\release\ missing   │
│ Health:    curl http://127.0.0.1:4000/health                │
│ HEAD:      dcbff04 (fix scheduler entry point)              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ SOVEREIGN TOOLS (the only MCP interface) ──────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  CLIENT ──MCP──▶ :4000/sse or /messages                     │
│                                                              │
│  tylluan_do ────▶ natural language → router → guild → result │
│  tylluan_remember ▶ content → SilvaDB node (embeddings+graph)│
│  tylluan_recall ──▶ query → BM25+vector+rerank → top results │
│  tylluan_think ───▶ query → graph traversal → analysis       │
│  tylluan_graph ───▶ add_triple|query_path|stats|ppr          │
│                                                              │
│  Defined:  transport/server/tools.rs → all_tools()          │
│  INVARIANT: exactly 5 tools, always.                        │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ KERNEL ARCHITECTURE ───────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  main.rs ──▶ config.rs ──▶ transport/http/                  │
│     │                          │                            │
│     ├── registry/  guild lifecycle                          │
│     │    mod.rs          spawn/stop/health                  │
│     │    supervisor.rs   crash loop detect + backoff        │
│     │    guild_process.rs  spawn + registry persistence     │
│     │                                                       │
│     ├── router/  intent → guild mapping                     │
│     │    catalog.rs      guild descriptors + trigger_phrases│
│     │    matcher.rs      BM25 + anchors                     │
│     │    embeddings.rs   BGE-M3 ONNX                       │
│     │                                                       │
│     ├── memory/  all persistence                            │
│     │    silva/          knowledge graph + vectors          │
│     │      query_cache.rs  M21: embed cache TTL 300s LRU256 │
│     │    coloquio.rs     agent channels                     │
│     │    hybrid.rs       BM25+vector fusion                 │
│     │                                                       │
│     ├── federation/  P2P mesh                               │
│     │    mod.rs           peer sync + provenance            │
│     │    (tylluan-link)   DHT, gossip, Noise XK, NAT        │
│     │                                                       │
│     └── security/  guards                                   │
│          circuit_breaker.rs                                 │
│          rate_limiter.rs                                    │
│          intent_filter.rs  30 security tests               │
│                                                             │
│  transport/                                                  │
│    http/mod.rs      axum router, HttpState                  │
│    http/auth.rs     bearer token middleware                  │
│    http/sse.rs      SSE transport                           │
│    server/handler_do/   tylluan_do pipeline                 │
│      routing.rs     intent → guild → tool                   │
│      embedding.rs   semantic similarity                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ GUILD SYSTEM (Python subprocesses via fastmcp) ────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  guilds/core/       42 guilds auto-discovered               │
│  Always-on (tylluan.toml always_on):                        │
│    bash, filesystem, monitor, system_metrics, vision        │
│    knowledge, coloquio, websearch, deep_web_research        │
│    code_graph, scrapling, scheduler                         │
│                                                             │
│  On-demand (lazy):                                          │
│    coordinator, git, docker, code, database, ingest         │
│    pdf, deep_analysis, navigator, codebase_memory ...       │
│                                                              │
│  KEY: scheduler.py MUST have entry point at end:            │
│    if __name__ == "__main__": utils.safe_mcp_run(mcp)       │
│    Without it: process exits → supervisor crash loop        │
│    Fixed: commit dcbff04                                    │
│                                                              │
│  Routing: catalog.rs trigger_phrases per guild              │
│  Spawn:   registry/supervisor.rs manages lifecycle          │
│  Config:  tylluan.toml [guilds.core] always_on list         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ DATA LAYER ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                              │
│  data/silva.db        knowledge graph (nodes, edges, FTS5)  │
│  data/active_port.json  runtime port (4000 by default)      │
│  data/scheduler.db    scheduler persistence                 │
│                                                              │
│  Embeddings: BGE-M3 via fastembed-rs (ONNX, DirectML GPU)  │
│  Reranker:   Jina reranker-v1-turbo (ONNX)                 │
│  Vectors:    768-dim BGE-M3                                 │
│  Search:     BM25 (FTS5) + vector + rerank + LinearRAG      │
│  M21 Cache:  query_cache.rs — normalize → Mutex<HashMap>    │
│              TTL 300s, max 256 LRU, invalidated on remember │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

┌─ P2P MESH (tylluan-link) ───────────────────────────────────┐
│  Ed25519 node identity + node signing                       │
│  STUN NAT traversal + mDNS LAN autodiscovery                │
│  DHT Kademlia (256 K-buckets, mainline BitTorrent bootstrap) │
│  Gossip protocol (push-pull, LRU, anti-entropy)             │
│  Noise XK encrypted transport (ChaCha20-Poly1305)           │
│  DispatchRouter: score=(1-load)×(1000/latency)×gpu_mult     │
│  M14-F Phase 3 PENDING: p2p_pool in HttpState               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

