┌─ SAFETY INVARIANTS ─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ✋ NEVER host=0.0.0.0 + dev_mode=true (LAN RCE)           │
│  ✋ NEVER reduce timeouts (CPU inference, not cloud)        │
│  ✋ NEVER write .tylluan-token value in tracked files       │
│  ✋ NEVER git push without José's explicit approval         │
│  ✋ NEVER start processes via Bash tool (AV blocks it)      │
│  ✋ Port :4000-4002 is Tylluan. Port :3030 is Forja.        │
│     Never run both on same port.                            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
